<Legal title="Copyright & DMCA" description="How rights holders can contact YToMP4 about copyrighted content." updated="October 11, 2026">
  <p>YToMP4 respects the rights of creators. We do not host a library of videos or music; files are generated on request from links provided by users and deleted automatically shortly afterwards.</p>
  <p>If you are a copyright owner or an authorised agent and believe our service is being used to infringe your rights, send a notice to <a href="mailto:dmca@ytomp4.com">dmca@ytomp4.com</a> including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>identification of the copyrighted work;</li>
    <li>the URL(s) of the content concerned;</li>
    <li>your contact details;</li>
    <li>a statement of good-faith belief that the use is not authorised;</li>
    <li>a statement, under penalty of perjury, that the information is accurate and that you are authorised to act for the rights holder;</li>
    <li>your physical or electronic signature.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We will review valid notices promptly and may block the conversion of the identified content.</p>
</Legal>
